    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nLet's see if AI can style the page using the mood board!\r\n\r\n1. Add your mood board from your Backpack to the project.\r\n\r\n   You can also use one of the samples in the `sample_mood_board` folder if you don't have one!\r\n\r\n2. Attach the mood board to the AI Tutor chat.\r\n3. Ask the AI to style the page based on your mood board.\r\n4. If it's not quite right, iterate with the AI to improve the styling.",
